# w69-hidden (the operator, 2026-10-10): "card hidden by windbrisk heights shows as 'card 59' with no art.
# … if we need to show a hidden card, can we use a literal 'hidden card' with an ephemeral card back?" and
# "when multiple hidden cards are there lets make sure they each get their own 'hidden' card. at the moment
# it's showing 'card 3' and 'card 59' but only if i open the expanded exile view."
# Alice holds two Windbrisk Heights at her own main phase, and Exploration lets her play both: each
# Hideaway 4 looks at the top four of her library (eight different cards) and exiles one face down. Forge
# lets her look at hers (the Hideaway effect's MayLookAt), so her screen is sent their names; bob's is not.
